#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute quantum experiments {#step-3-execute-quantum-experiments}"
msgstr ""
"Paso 3: Ejecutar experimentos cuánticos {#step-3-execute-quantum-"
"experiments}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate expectation value {#calculate-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Calcular el valor esperado {#calculate-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, we can run the backpropagated experiments and compare them with the"
" full experiment using the noiseless "
"[StatevectorEstimator](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator)."
" We can see that the backpropagated expectation value without truncation is "
"equivalent to the exact value within the limits of numerical precision.\n"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, podemos ejecutar los experimentos retropropagados y compararlos "
"con el experimento completo usando el "
"[StatevectorEstimator](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator)"
" sin ruido. Podemos ver que el valor esperado retropropagado sin "
"truncamiento es equivalente al valor exacto dentro de los límites de "
"precisión numérica.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The expectation value on the operator with truncated terms has some error on"
" the order of ``1e-4``, which is within the expected tolerance.\n"
msgstr ""
"El valor esperado del operador con términos truncados tiene cierto error del"
" orden de ``1e-4``, que está dentro de la tolerancia esperada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** We use a statevector-based ``Estimator`` primitive to illustrate "
"the effect of truncation on the output. To run on the backend to which the "
"experiments were transpiled in Step 2, one would import the "
"[EstimatorV2](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) from ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` and pass the backend "
"instance into the constructor.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** Usamos un ``Estimator`` primitivo basado en statevector para "
"ilustrar el efecto del truncamiento en la salida. Para ejecutar en el "
"Backend al que se transpilaron los experimentos en el Paso 2, se importaría "
"el [EstimatorV2](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) de ``qiskit-ibm-runtime`` y se pasaría la instancia "
"del backend al constructor.\n"

